{"4098810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Joltstone", "steam_appid": 4098810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joltstone is the next game from solo developer Soulnata!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build large, armored rigs and battle over minerals that you can drill for across an array of planets, working for a clan of your choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a robot battling game - rigs are for drilling! Collect rare minerals to increase your clan rank faster - and unlock new rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hoard Crystals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't stop there. Another innovation is that the minerals you collect appear on your rig. You can see them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystal Shield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait - there's more! Carried minerals act as extra armor, essentially giving your rig a shield bonus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystal Overboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out! Getting attacked can cause you to drop those precious minerals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rig Wars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your mineral shield to attack enemy bases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extraction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you want to escape with those minerals intact, call for extraction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who do you fight for?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back on your ship, you can join a clan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clan Ladders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new parts, paints, and more for your clan as you drill and complete missions for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Rig</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your new parts and paints to build a highly customizable rig of your imagination with countless configuration possibilities!  Jump straight into the action by choosing a pre-built rig blueprint with many blueprints unlockable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also earn licenses to explore and drill on new planetoids!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joltstone is the next game from solo developer Soulnata!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build large, armored rigs and battle over minerals that you can drill for across an array of planets, working for a clan of your choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Innovative Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a robot battling game - rigs are for drilling! Collect rare minerals to increase your clan rank faster - and unlock new rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hoard Crystals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't stop there. Another innovation is that the minerals you collect appear on your rig. You can see them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystal Shield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait - there's more! Carried minerals act as extra armor, essentially giving your rig a shield bonus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crystal Overboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out! Getting attacked can cause you to drop those precious minerals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rig Wars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your mineral shield to attack enemy bases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extraction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you want to escape with those minerals intact, call for extraction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who do you fight for?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back on your ship, you can join a clan.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clan Ladders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new parts, paints, and more for your clan as you drill and complete missions for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Rig</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your new parts and paints to build a highly customizable rig of your imagination with countless configuration possibilities!  Jump straight into the action by choosing a pre-built rig blueprint with many blueprints unlockable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also earn licenses to explore and drill on new planetoids!</p>", "short_description": "Build large, armored rigs and battle over minerals that you can drill for across an array of planets, working for a clan of your choice.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098810/f81c1bca4b449b611f6d9a4657648058e11a4328/header.jpg?t=1766500280", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098810/55072dd28f6300f3c2b588d122032571792d91ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766500280", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098810/55072dd28f6300f3c2b588d122032571792d91ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766500280", "website": "http://soulnata.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 8.1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 with the ARB_framebuffer_object extension (or alternatively at least OpenGL 3.0)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL-Soft for audio<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Gamepad or mouse recommended.  Offers a keyboard-only mode.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9300H CPU @ 2.40GHz (2.40 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650, OpenGL 2.0 with the ARB_framebuffer_object extension (or alternatively at least OpenGL 3.0)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL-Soft for audio<br></li><li><